{"type":"message","id":"343e28c7","parentId":"ea3f1f53","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:42:49.513Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"我看到上次更新时间是7:12，现在是7:42。根据HEARTBEAT.md规则，我需要：\n1. 检查是否有紧急事项\n2. 检查是否需要主动提醒\n\n现在时间是7:42，已经过了不打扰时间段（23:00-08:00），所以可以进行检查。我需要检查日历、邮件、提及和天气等项目。\n\n不过，根据工作区上下文，我知道：\n- 用户的工作时间是8:00-21:00\n- 用户要求每日晨报在9点前推送\n- 现在是7:42，接近工作时间\n\n根据HEARTBEAT.md的\"主动提醒条件\"，我需要检查是否有未来2小时内的日程。让我先检查一下日历，不过需要先确认是否有日历相关的工具可用。根据之前的内存，用户有使用gcalcli-calendar的习惯。\n\n让我先尝试更新心跳状态，然后考虑是否需要生成晨报：\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_hiv9rlfxapi7ej6m0rcmls0b","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json","oldText":"{\n  \"lastChecks\": {\n    \"email\": 1774335722,\n    \"calendar\": 1774335722,\n    \"weather\": 1774344120,\n    \"mentions\": 1774328522\n  },\n  \"lastProactiveReachoutAt\": 1774052344,\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-25T07:12:00+08:00\"\n}","newText":"{\n  \"lastChecks\": {\n    \"email\": 1774335722,\n    \"calendar\": 1774335722,\n    \"weather\": 1774344120,\n    \"mentions\": 1774328522\n  },\n  \"lastProactiveReachoutAt\": 1774052344,\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-25T07:42:00+08:00\"\n}"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":24269,"output":453,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24722,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774395750967}}
{"type":"message","id":"3ff1a9c1","parentId":"343e28c7","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:42:49.528Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_hiv9rlfxapi7ej6m0rcmls0b","toolName":"edit","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Successfully replaced text in /root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/heartbeat-state.json."}],"details":{"diff":"    ...\n  5     \"weather\": 1774344120,\n  6     \"mentions\": 1774328522\n  7   },\n  8   \"lastProactiveReachoutAt\": 1774052344,\n- 9   \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-25T07:12:00+08:00\"\n+ 9   \"updatedAt\": \"2026-03-25T07:42:00+08:00\"\n 10 }","firstChangedLine":9},"isError":false,"timestamp":1774395769525}}
{"type":"message","id":"64eb7b0a","parentId":"3ff1a9c1","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:42:58.922Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在时间是7:42，根据USER.md，用户要求每日晨报在9点前推送。我需要生成晨报。根据HEARTBEAT.md的\"主动提醒条件\"：\"距离上次主动汇报已超过8小时，且确实有新信息\"，我应该生成晨报。\n\n让我检查一下是否有briefing技能可用。根据技能列表，有一个briefing技能，描述是：\"Daily briefing: gathers calendar (gcalcli-calendar), active todos (todo-management), and weather (openmeteo-sh-weather-simple) into a concise summary.\"\n\n我应该使用这个技能来生成晨报。让我先读取briefing技能的SKILL.md文件：\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5pb0y7ev59a0mowamuunst4c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/briefing/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":24760,"output":193,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24953,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774395769527}}
{"type":"message","id":"38a45b58","parentId":"64eb7b0a","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:42:58.936Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_5pb0y7ev59a0mowamuunst4c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: briefing\ndescription: \"Daily briefing: gathers calendar (gcalcli-calendar), active todos (todo-management), and weather (openmeteo-sh-weather-simple) into a concise summary.\"\nmetadata: {\"openclaw\":{\"emoji\":\"📋\"}}\nuser-invocable: true\n---\n\n# Briefing\n\nCompose a daily briefing using companion skills. Each source is optional — skip it if the skill is not available.\n\n## Sources\n\nThree companion skills. Skip any that are not in the available skills list:\n\n- **Calendar** — `gcalcli-calendar`\n- **Todos** — `todo-management`\n- **Weather** — `openmeteo-sh-weather-simple` (requires a default city/country in session context)\n\nIf **none** of the three are available — tell the user you have nothing to build a briefing from and stop. Do not fabricate a briefing.\n\n## Briefing day\n\nDecide whether the user's day is effectively over based on current time and today's remaining calendar events.\n\n- Day still active -> briefing covers **today**.\n- Day winding down -> briefing covers **tomorrow**.\n\nTodos are not date-bound — always show active items.\n\n## Gather\n\nFor each available source, **read its `SKILL.md` before calling any commands**.\n\n### Calendar\n\n1. Read `gcalcli-calendar` SKILL.md.\n2. Fetch the **briefing day's** agenda.\n3. If no events — note it.\n\n### Todos\n\n1. Read `todo-management` SKILL.md.\n2. List **active/pending** items.\n3. If none — note it.\n\n### Weather\n\n1. Get the **briefing day's** conditions and forecast. Use the user's default city/country from session context.\n2. Commands (always use `--llm`):\n   - Today: `openmeteo weather --current --forecast-days=1 --city=\"{city}\" --llm`\n   - Tomorrow: `openmeteo weather --current --forecast-days=2 --forecast-since=2 --city=\"{city}\" --llm`\n\n### On errors\n\nIf a command fails, skip that section and mention the failure briefly. Do not retry more than once. Never fabricate data.\n\n## Compose\n\nBuild a single message. Include only sections whose skill was available. If a skill returned no data, still include the section with a one-line note.\n\n### Structure\n\n1. **Title line** — compact: date, day-of-week, time. E.g. `Брифинг 14.02 (пт, 8:12)`. If briefing day is tomorrow, say so.\n2. **Weather** — 1–2 lines: temperature, sky, anything notable.\n3. **Calendar** — briefing day's events, chronologically. Format: `HH:MM — Title`. All-day events first. If empty: one line noting no events.\n4. **Upcoming** — next 2-3 days' notable events (if any), one line per day. Omit if nothing notable.\n5. **Todos** — active items, briefly. Higher priority first if supported. If empty: one line noting no todos.\n\n### Example output\n\nFollow this format exactly in the user's language:\n```\nBriefing 14.02 (Sat, 8:12)\n\n**🌤 Weather (London, UK)**\n+2°C, cloudy, wind 11 km/h. Daytime to -3°C, light rain.\n\n**📅 Calendar**\n09:00 — Standup\n14:00 — Sprint review\n18:30 — Driving school\n\n**🔜 Upcoming**\n• 15.02: Free day.\n• 16.02: Daily standup 12:00, Driving school 18:30.\n\n**✅ Todos**\n• [work] Debug feature X.\n• [personal] Book a doctor's appointment.\n```\nNote: bold header → content immediately on next line (zero blank lines); one blank line between sections; no trailing question or CTA.\n\n### Formatting rules (strict)\n\nThese rules are critical for readability on mobile. Follow them exactly.\n\n- **Between sections**: exactly one empty line.\n- **Between a section header and its content**: zero empty lines. Content starts on the very next line.\n- Right:\n```\n**Calendar**\n09:00 — Standup\n14:00 — Review\n```\n- Wrong:\n```\n**Calendar**\n\n09:00 — Standup\n14:00 — Review\n```\n- When briefing day is tomorrow, calendar and weather headers should reflect that.\n- Do not shorten the user's city name.\n- Match the language of the user's request.\n- Simple formatting — optimize for mobile chat. Bold section headers, short lines.\n- Concise, skimmable, no filler.\n\n### Strict prohibitions\n\n- No preamble — dive straight in.\n- No call to action or question at the end. The briefing ends after the last section. No \"What's next?\", \"What's first?\", or similar.\n- Never invent events, todos, or weather data. Only report what tools returned.\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774395778933}}
{"type":"message","id":"20ee1555","parentId":"38a45b58","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:43:11.993Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"现在我需要检查briefing技能所需的三个配套技能是否可用。让我查看可用的技能列表：\n\n根据之前的技能列表，我需要检查：\n1. gcalcli-calendar - 不在可用技能列表中\n2. todo-management - 不在可用技能列表中  \n3. openmeteo-sh-weather-simple - 不在可用技能列表中\n\n不过，我看到有一个weather技能，描述是：\"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\" 这可能是一个替代方案。\n\n根据briefing技能的规则：\"If **none** of the three are available — tell the user you have nothing to build a briefing from and stop. Do not fabricate a briefing.\"\n\n由于三个配套技能都不在可用技能列表中，我无法生成完整的晨报。但是，根据HEARTBEAT.md的规则，我需要考虑是否需要主动提醒。\n\n让我检查一下是否有其他信息需要提醒用户。根据USER.md，用户要求每日晨报在9点前推送，现在是7:42，我应该在9点前生成晨报。\n\n不过，由于缺少必要的技能，我无法生成完整的晨报。让我检查一下是否有weather技能可用，至少可以提供天气信息：\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_pzg3uya10kz1518gnmtmi2d6","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/weather/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"deepseek-v3.2","usage":{"input":26037,"output":293,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26330,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774395778936}}
{"type":"message","id":"7c0e7e11","parentId":"20ee1555","timestamp":"2026-03-24T23:43:12.017Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_pzg3uya10kz1518gnmtmi2d6","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: weather\ndescription: Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\nhomepage: https://wttr.in/:help\nmetadata: {\"clawdbot\":{\"emoji\":\"🌤️\",\"requires\":{\"bins\":[\"curl\"]}}}\n---\n\n# Weather\n\nTwo free services, no API keys needed.\n\n## wttr.in (primary)\n\nQuick one-liner:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=3\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C\n```\n\nCompact format:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?format=%l:+%c+%t+%h+%w\"\n# Output: London: ⛅️ +8°C 71% ↙5km/h\n```\n\nFull forecast:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"wttr.in/London?T\"\n```\n\nFormat codes: `%c` condition · `%t` temp · `%h` humidity · `%w` wind · `%l` location · `%m` moon\n\nTips:\n- URL-encode spaces: `wttr.in/New+York`\n- Airport codes: `wttr.in/JFK`\n- Units: `?m` (metric) `?u` (USCS)\n- Today only: `?1` · Current only: `?0`\n- PNG: `curl -s \"wttr.in/Berlin.png\" -o /tmp/weather.png`\n\n## Open-Meteo (fallback, JSON)\n\nFree, no key, good for programmatic use:\n```bash\ncurl -s \"https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude=51.5&longitude=-0.12&current_weather=true\"\n```\n\nFind coordinates for a city, then query. Returns JSON with temp, windspeed, weathercode.\n\nDocs: https://open-meteo.com/en/docs\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774395792014}}
